e Beira D, you descend, a fragile light in the crushing dark. Your mission: uncover the fate of the crew and recover what remains of their passing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But this is no silent, resting grave. The wreck screeches and shifts around you. It wakes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465690/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1750237107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use precision tools to cut through the steel and silt. Navigate disorientation, resist the pull of the deep, and hold fast to your sanity. You want answers. But something down there wants you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Submerge yourself in the latest first-person narrative adventure from The Chinese Room, the second entry in the multi-BAFTA-award-winning Still Wakes the Deep universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465690/extras/Gif3-opt.gif?t=1750237107\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Descend into the Abyss:</strong> Dive to the wreckage of the Beira D, a steel grave teetering on the edge of a yawning undersea trench</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Confront Your Deepest Fears:</strong> Thalassophobia, paranoia, and the creeping unreliability of memory </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forensic Dive:</strong> Collect mementos of the dead, photograph human remains, and piece together the Beira D crew\u2019s final, terrifying moments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Desperate Survival:</strong> Swim, climb, and squeeze through the contorted, unstable remains of the rig to uncover the dark secrets it keeps </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Come Prepared:</strong> Wield a cutting arc, undersea flares, and a crowbar to break into sealed areas, and document your findings with a deep-sea camera</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Voices in the Void:</strong> Communicate with your diving partner and dive support supervisor through fragile 1986 undersea communications technology </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Still Wakes the Deep: Siren\u2019s Rest contains new Achievements. </p>","developers":["The Chinese Room"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1622910","name":"Still Wakes the Deep"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465690/c621ccfe681a178ed780ff98d3f42368c1e1e948/header.jpg?t=1750237107","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92025 Sumo Digital Limited t/a The Chinese Room. Published by Secret Mode Limited. All trademarks and copyrights are property of their respective owners. All rights reserved. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSECRET MODE, the SECRET MODE logos and the crossed keys GLHF logo are registered trade marks of Secret Mode Limited","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257157791,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157791/movie480.mp4?t=1750236670","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157791/movie_max.mp4?t=1750236670"},"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157791/01850c156bdb307d975626c8d1f3d31159cf4982/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750236670","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157791/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750236670","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257157791/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=175023667